    controversy_html: `<p><strong>Predatory cosmetic targeting of children:</strong> Stumble Guys' cosmetic system exhibits multiple predatory design patterns targeting children, including gacha mechanics, FOMO-driven cosmetics, and unclear pricing. The game's young player demographic makes ethical cosmetic design particularly important and consistently absent.</p><p><strong>Opaque gacha mechanics:</strong> Cosmetic gacha mechanics lack transparent rate disclosure or pity mechanics. Players cannot determine expected cosmetic acquisition costs, making budgeting impossible and creating exploitation opportunities.</p>`,
